/ 共 12\\\\nstep: 112000 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\\\nvalue_eval_ratio_105K: 0.386 ↓（近 2 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1871, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012SPqYtRZutTgF5oDMzwjZU","session_id":"7613df98-66f2-4a91-8d2b-4836ebcfaf9d","uuid":"a5c4b778-61c8-4670-8e71-dd649eda9b93","timestamp":"2026-05-14T06:56:22.710Z"}
